@host = http://localhost:5150

# The SubstrateApi's own identity, from appsettings.json. Any seeded participant with a valid
# secret works — NFlix's is a817f520-c7e5-4831-a67b-171902bf28ba / NFlix.
@participant = 80aa28e0-faca-4984-a1ac-bfa2e2d3926c
@secret = SubstrateApi

### Heartbeat
GET {{host}}/api/home

### Submit a media item — accepted (202), and it appears on the chat UI moments later
POST {{host}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-EventHighwayParticipant: {{participant}}
X-EventHighwayParticipantSecret: {{secret}}

{
  "Id": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
  "Title": "Dune: Part Two",
  "Type": "Movie",
  "Genres": [ "Sci-Fi", "Adventure" ],
  "Rating": 8.5
}

### Submit the SAME content again, within a minute — quarantined by loop detection (400).
### Loop detection is configured here as "one identical item per minute", so the same request
### sent later than that is accepted again rather than refused.
POST {{host}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-EventHighwayParticipant: {{participant}}
X-EventHighwayParticipantSecret: {{secret}}

{
  "Id": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
  "Title": "Dune: Part Two",
  "Type": "Movie",
  "Genres": [ "Sci-Fi", "Adventure" ],
  "Rating": 8.5
}

### Wrong secret — refused by the substrate (400: "Event participant secret not found.")
POST {{host}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-EventHighwayParticipant: {{participant}}
X-EventHighwayParticipantSecret: not-the-secret

{
  "Id": "22222222-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
  "Title": "Nope",
  "Type": "Movie",
  "Rating": 6.8
}

### Missing a title — refused by validation (400, naming the field)
POST {{host}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-EventHighwayParticipant: {{participant}}
X-EventHighwayParticipantSecret: {{secret}}

{
  "Id": "33333333-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
  "Type": "Movie",
  "Rating": 6.8
}

### Post straight to /receive — bypasses the highway entirely, but proves the chat renders
### whatever arrives. This is the call the SubstrateApi listener's delegate client makes.
POST {{host}}/receive
Content-Type: application/json
X-Highway: substrate-api-secret

{
  "Title": "Delivered by hand",
  "Note": "The highway normally makes this call, not you."
}
